            <strong>Encapsulation:</strong> Hiding internal data (private attributes like <code>_cost</code>) and controlling access via methods.
            <br><br>
            <strong>Static Variables:</strong> Variables that belong to the <em>Class</em> itself, not any single object. Useful for counters (e.g., counting <em>all</em> visitors in the park).
        </p>
