            <li><strong>Open <code>3_themepark.py</code></strong> from your downloads folder.</li>
            <li>Focus on <code>attempt_ride(self, visitor)</code>. This method acts as a Gatekeeper.</li>
            <li><strong>Logic Check 1:</strong> Compare <code>visitor.height_cm</code> against <code>self._min_height</code>. If too short, print a message and <code>return</code> (exit the function).</li>
            <li><strong>Logic Check 2:</strong> Check if visitor has enough money.</li>
            <li><strong>Transaction:</strong> If checks pass, subtract cost from visitor and add to ride earnings.</li>
